abstract: "Empirical benchmark of physics-informed world models (hard residual PINN, soft PINN, ensembles, tilemap and multi-entity variants) against statistical MLP/LSTM baselines for discrete-time dynamics modeling of Super Mario World (SNES) from genuine WRAM telemetry, including closed-loop MPC, Dyna-PPO, DAgger and cross-stage generalization."
